    "title": "St. Louis County tire warehouse to close this spring; 143 impacted - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Megan Mueller ,\n9 hours ago HAZELWOOD, Mo. – More than 100 people will be affected by a “mass layoff” this April when a St. Louis County tire warehouse closes its doors. A Missouri WARN notice was posted Monday, announcing the closure of two warehouses in Hazelwood belonging to Community Wholesale Tire Dis. Inc., effective April 10. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
